{{> head officeStyles=true}}<body class="office">{{#if user}}{{> staffNav}}{{else}}<header class="office-header"><div class="office-brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/">SmartCivi</a><a href="/login" class="button">Sign in</a></div></header>{{/if}}<main id="main" class="office-main"><header class="page-heading"><div><h1>Help and office guidance</h1><p>{{officeName}}</p></div></header><section class="panel"><h2>Request a civil document</h2><p>Sign in, open Citizen services and choose a certificate request or appointment. Use My requests to follow processing, and Notifications for updates. Bring the identity and supporting documents required by the registry office.</p><h2>Change an appointment</h2><p>Open Appointments and send a reschedule request with your preferred schedule. The office confirms the new date. Times are shown in Philippine time.</p><h2>Payments and official copies</h2><p>Online payments are demonstrations and do not transfer funds. Confirm actual fees, payment instructions and official document release with the Bansud Municipal Civil Registry office. Generated document previews do not replace an officially issued certificate.</p><h2>Account and record corrections</h2><p>Contact authorized Bansud LGU personnel for account or civil-record corrections. Keep your password private. Civil records are available only to authorized office roles.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/browse">Citizen services</a><a class="button secondary" href="/offices">Office directory</a></div></section></main>{{> officeFooter}}</body></html>
